sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as Person at the greeter
    participant G as GDM
    participant P as pam_fprintd<br/>uid 0
    participant D as elanprintd
    participant S as prints.json
    participant C as sensor

    U->>G: picks an account
    G->>P: gdm-fingerprint PAM stack
    P->>D: Claim alice
    activate D
    D->>D: caller uid via GetConnectionUnixUser
    Note over D: uid 0 or the owner of the prints,<br/>otherwise PermissionDenied
    D->>C: 40 ff 04  enrolled_num
    C-->>D: 40 01
    Note over D,C: arming. Without this every<br/>touch-wait stays silent forever

    P->>D: VerifyStart any
    D->>S: which slots does alice own?
    S-->>D: slot 0, left index finger
    U->>C: presents a finger
    D->>C: 40 ff 03  verify
    Note over C: matched against every<br/>template in flash, no id is sent
    C-->>D: 40 00, slot 0 matched

    alt slot 0 is one of alice's
        D-->>P: verify-match
        P-->>G: session opens
    else slot belongs to another user, or to nobody
        D-->>P: verify-no-match
        Note over D: an orphaned template<br/>authenticates nobody
    end

    P->>D: Release
    deactivate D
